sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If an equilateral pentagon is inscribed in a circle which has its diameter rational, then the side of the pentagon is the irrational straight line called minor.
----
proof:

In the circle *ABCDE* which has its diameter rational let the equilateral pentagon *ABCDE* be inscribed.

I say that the side of the pentagon is the irrational straight line called minor.

